      "writtenOn": "2026-08-31T19:24:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The project API is for commits, not changes? I really think that being able to show other related changes is useful, even if this isn\u0027t doing this now, so I am not eager to close this door. I suspect you are doing this because bots are calling this API for open changes, and maybe that is why you are? What is that impact of this to you currently?",
      "parentUuid": "b4c15b6f_1b4dd9ea",
      "revId": "6f6983b01484263f9c40c91503409b2e95f47f4d",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
