      "writtenOn": "2026-09-01T00:11:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t really have a specific use case in mind other than what the API says it should do. The API does not currently describe this as being for merged changes only. I realize you are suggesting changing that, but you haven\u0027t really given a good reason to do so. Isn\u0027t the expense going to be the same once the change is merged?",
      "parentUuid": "df636c59_78dcc944",
      "revId": "6f6983b01484263f9c40c91503409b2e95f47f4d",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
